  "sectionId": "s6",
  "title": "From Local Direction to Accepted Policy",
  "introduction": "Follow an old-policy batch through TRPO's sampled surrogate and average-KL constraint. Conjugate gradient produces one search direction; backtracking preserves that direction while shortening the trial step. The failure-then-success path is symbolic, not a reported run.",
  "entities": [
